# Reawakening OS - applications that are not part of the desktop itself.
#
# Jellyfin Desktop (the official Jellyfin Media Player) from Jellyfin's own
# archive, because Debian does not package it. It is a Qt 6 + libmpv front end:
# browsing the library uses QtWebEngine, playback goes through libmpv, so
# hardware decoding is shared with the rest of the system instead of adding a
# second multimedia stack. It is deliberately the *player*, not the server.
jellyfin-media-player
# The Qt 6 Wayland platform plugin. Without it the player falls back to X11
# through XWayland: it still starts, but with a different scaling and input path
# than every other window on this desktop.
qt6-wayland

# VA-API: hardware video decoding. The drivers are in the desktop list; these
# are the client libraries and the diagnostic that says whether the GPU can
# actually decode anything.
libva2
libva-drm2
vainfo
